@startuml 添加服装顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 80
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultWidth 400
skinparam sequenceArrowColor Black
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40


actor "商家" as Merchant
participant "ProductManage.vue" as Frontend
participant "ProductController" as Controller
participant "数据库" as Database

Merchant -> Frontend++: 点击"添加服装",填写服装信息
Frontend -> Controller++: POST /api/products
Controller -> Controller: 校验库存不能为负数
Controller -> Controller: 校验必须选择分类
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO products
Database --> Controller--: 返回服装ID
Controller -> Database++: 查询验证分类ID有效性
Database --> Controller--: 返回有效分类ID
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO product_categories
Database --> Controller--: 返回插入结果
Controller --> Frontend--: 返回创建成功
Frontend --> Merchant--: 显示添加成功提示

@enduml
